{"info": {"author": "Meridian Labs", "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": [], "description": "Welcome to Inspect SWE, a suite of software engineering agents for [Inspect AI](https://inspect.aisi.org.uk/).\n\nFor details on using Inspect SWE, please visit <https://meridianlabs-ai.github.io/inspect_swe/>.\n\n## Installation\n\nLatest development version:\n\n```bash\npip install git+https://github.com/meridianlabs-ai/inspect_swe\n```\n\n## Development\n\nTo work on development of Inspect SWE, clone the repository and install it with [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (0.13.4 or later) and the `[dev]` optional dependencies:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/meridianlabs-ai/inspect_swe\ncd inspect_swe\nuv sync --locked --extra dev\n```\n\nTo build the docs, run `uv sync --locked --extra dev --extra doc` instead.\n\nRun the commands below from the `.venv` that `uv sync` creates: `uv run <command>`, `.venv/bin/<command>`, or `source .venv/bin/activate`.\n\nRun linting, formatting, and tests via\n\n```bash\nmake check\nmake test\n```\n\n### Sandbox-specific tests\n\nNote that most tests depend on a valid sandbox being available (either `docker` or `k8s`), this is inferred from your shell environment.\n\nYou can check which are collected via `pytest --co`\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": "MIT License", "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "inspect-swe", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/inspect-swe/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/inspect-swe/", "project_urls": {"Documentation": "https://meridianlabs-ai.github.io/inspect_swe/", "Issue Tracker": "https://github.com/meridianlabs-ai/inspect_swe/issues", "Source Code": "https://github.com/meridianlabs-ai/inspect_swe"}, "provides_extra": ["dev", "doc"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/inspect-swe/0.3.2/", "requires_dist": ["agent-client-protocol>=0.11.0", "anyio", "httpx", "inspect-ai>=0.3.291", "nest-asyncio", "platformdirs", "pydantic>=2.13.0", "pyyaml", "sniffio", "typing-extensions>=4.9.0", "anthropic>=2.0.0; extra == \"dev\"", "google-genai>=3.3.0; extra == \"dev\"", "inspect-evals; extra == \"dev\"", "inspect-k8s-sandbox; extra == \"dev\"", "ipython; extra == \"dev\"", "mini-swe-agent; extra == \"dev\"", "mypy; extra == \"dev\"", "openai>=3.4.0; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest-dotenv; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest-timeout; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest-xdist; extra == \"dev\"", "ruff; extra == \"dev\"", "types-pyyaml; extra == \"dev\"", "griffe>=2; extra == \"doc\"", "markdown; extra == \"doc\"", "panflute; extra == \"doc\"", "quarto-cli>=1.9.36; extra == \"doc\"", "rich; extra == \"doc\""], "requires_python": ">=3.11", "summary": "Software engineering agents for Inspect AI.", "version": "0.3.2", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"0.1.5": "2025-08-30T14:49:09.980006Z", "0.2.0": "2025-08-30T16:45:13.064290Z", "0.2.1": "2025-08-30T17:11:45.580646Z", "0.2.10": "2025-09-03T16:02:22.549313Z", "0.2.11": "2025-09-07T01:37:43.928723Z", "0.2.12": "2025-09-08T21:39:13.901883Z", "0.2.13": "2025-09-12T15:14:04.687936Z", "0.2.14": "2025-09-22T16:45:37.968007Z", "0.2.15": "2025-09-24T01:09:15.343386Z", "0.2.16.dev2": "2025-09-24T17:48:31.989718Z", "0.2.17": "2025-09-27T13:57:20.780833Z", "0.2.18": "2025-09-30T11:51:50.355547Z", "0.2.19": "2025-10-05T13:20:53.399285Z", "0.2.20": "2025-10-07T15:31:56.025965Z", "0.2.21": "2025-10-16T19:59:22.235065Z", "0.2.22": "2025-10-16T20:01:03.835777Z", "0.2.23": "2025-10-28T00:06:13.004277Z", "0.2.24": "2025-11-01T13:31:57.932424Z", "0.2.25": "2025-11-07T13:12:25.094645Z", "0.2.26": "2025-11-15T20:37:23.699315Z", "0.2.27": "2025-11-27T15:01:51.983245Z", "0.2.28": "2025-12-05T18:15:14.547201Z",